00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.630
Episode 72

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.630
The True Form of the Metarex!?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.910
There's nothing ahead.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:51.210
Wars always occur in this area.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.630
This was never a comfortable place to live, but...

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.800
The Metarex are too ruthless!

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:01.640
I've seen many destroyed planets.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:06.480
Are you seriously going to keep going ahead?

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.390
I don't recommend it.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.810
It's a world of death.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:21.240
What should we do?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.490
You don't have to come with me if you don't want to.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:27.040
What's with that remark?

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.290
Who brought you all the way here?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:33.750
I'll figure out transportation on my own.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.300
Thank you for your help.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.050
Shadow...

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.560
Hey, wait up!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.120
There are Metarex fighters behind us!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.370
Three... No, five of them!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.120
Again?

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.790
We just got rid of them awhile ago!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.800
According to the radar, they've locked on!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.090
Dispersing decoys.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.180
Chris, after you destroy the missile, I want you and Sonic to counterattack!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.220
Roger.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.930
Cosmo, take over for me.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:25.890
Right!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.430
Engines at full throttle!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.980
When Sonic leaves, full speed ahead!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.690
Leave it to me!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.200
What a hectic day!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:49.870
We finally make it to an area without many space-time distortions, but we're now always being chased.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.870
We don't have time to search for the Chaos Emeralds.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:56.210
But we can't let them chase us down!

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.220
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:14.190
Yes, the Metarex attacks are more violent than before.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.900
Doesn't it feel like they're anticipating our moves?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.280
Does that mean the Metarex know where we're going?

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.160
Ready for launch!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.160
Roger! Launch!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.160
Taking off!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.830
That came from below!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.040
It can't be! There's nothing on the radar!

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:50.680
This ship is a piece of cake!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.430
It's him! Yellow Zelkova!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.150
Where's Zelkova?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:05.780
He heard that we found the Controller of Light's location, so he left on his own.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.990
Without waiting for Dark Oak's orders?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.700
That is unbecoming of a Metarex boss!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:16.460
There's nothing we could've done. He's stupid.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.960
Take this!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.090
This is crazy!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.430
I feel sick...

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.510
The energy bypass has been severed!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.890
We can't move the ship!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:15.680
What?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.990
I'm the most powerful in the galaxy!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:31.990
Question: You're scared to go there at night, but the people who live there are fine.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.740
Where is this?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.960
A movie theater?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.000
No, that has nothing to do with nighttime.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.880
I know! A graveyard!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:52.140
When you go to the graveyard at night, it's spooky. But the people living there are resting in peace!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.350
Ding! Correct!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:59.890
Therefore, this planet will become your grave!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.320
One more time!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.690
Cut it out!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.160
Sonic!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.620
Sonic, here we go!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.700
Okay!

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.550
Super Plasma Shield!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.130
What?

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.470
What was that?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.390
That's...

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:39.430
It's the same as when the Sonic Driver didn't work!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.810
That shield?

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.400
Correct!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:50.490
I'm equipped with the plasma shield generator that Dr. Eggman created!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:54.200
He also gave me an Eggman super sticker!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.530
What?

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:59.830
That's ugly! That's nothing to brag about!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.330
Amy, calm down!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.330
Don't provoke the enemy!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:08.880
I'll never forgive Eggman for teaming up with him!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:14.640
What? How dare you insult me when I'm dressed so stylish!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.800
I'll fight you!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.520
There you are, hedgehog!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.650
I'm an echidna!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:31.860
Although you can deflect ring energy, you can't avoid my punch!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:37.740
If it's the same Plasma Shield as before, we should be able to beat it the same way!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.040
Ring Road!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.790
Here I go!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.550
Get outta here!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.600
Sonic!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.510
Chris!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:01.600
Damn!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:06.060
Did you really think that we wouldn't fix our weak points?

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:10.230
