00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.980
Whatever!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.360
I don't care about your upgraded version!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:19.330
You're just relying on the shield's power, you oversized empty-headed idiot!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.910
What did you say?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.870
I'm gonna beat you to a pulp! I hope you're ready!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.680
What's with this place?

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:09.710
The Metarex want to create this type of world?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.750
