00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.610
No.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:25.830
Not good enough! Missiles and lasers don't work against my shield!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.540
Oh no!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.500
We can at least stall him! Keep attacking!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.790
