00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.660
Dr. Eggman has an inquisitive mind.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:31.460
He's doing this for the Metarex.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.000
Yellow Zelkova died.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.800
What?

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:43.010
He was wearing equipment that you designed for him, and he lost.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.140
What are you trying to say?

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.410
A Chaos Emerald?

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.790
No.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.670
This is a fake.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:24.840
Is this why they were making copies of the Chaos Emeralds?

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.690
What?

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:47.410
He's a member of the resistance.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:50.870
What happened?

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:57.170
This is what it means to survive...

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:05.090
This is tranquility and order...

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:09.800
You become a part of them...

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.350
Shadow...

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:18.310
My left pocket...

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:22.480
What's this?

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:28.240
Stop them...

